      "heading": "Search & Export Data",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Temukan template tertentu secara cepat menggunakan Search Panel dan lakukan backup seluruh daftar template Anda ke file CSV dengan fitur Export.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka & Mengisi Search Panel",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka search panel dengan mengklik tombol **Search** (ikon magnifying glass) di pojok kanan atas toolbar utama.\n• Search panel berupa Paper sidebar selebar 320px yang muncul di sisi kanan halaman.\n• Form menyediakan kolom input pencarian spesifik:\n  - **Template Name**: Input teks pencarian nama template (dilengkapi ikon 🔍 di sisi kiri).\n  - **Subject**: Input teks pencarian berdasarkan subjek pesan (dilengkapi ikon 🔍 di sisi kiri).\n  - **Platform**: Filter berdasarkan platform komunikasi tertentu (Email, Telegram, WhatsApp).\n• Tekan **Apply Filters** di footer panel untuk menerapkan kriteria pencarian ke main view.\n• Tekan **Reset** untuk mengosongkan seluruh filter dan memuat kembali semua data template.",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Search Template</div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#e0f2fe;border:1px solid #bae6fd;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;\">Search</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;\">Set filters and apply</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Template Name</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;\">Enter template name</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Subject</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;\">Enter subject</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Platform</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\">Choose platform <span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">▼</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(37,99,235,.25);\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Ekspor ke File CSV",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Export CSV** yang terletak di sebelah kanan atas header main view untuk mengunduh seluruh data template.\n• File akan terunduh otomatis ke storage lokal komputer Anda dengan nama berkas `message-templates.csv`.\n• Format CSV memuat data tabular lengkap:\n  - **Template ID**: ID internal database.\n  - **Template Name**: Nama pengenal template.\n  - **Subject**: Subjek pesan.\n  - **Template**: Body teks lengkap berisi parameter placeholder.\n• Gunakan file ekspor ini sebagai arsip eksternal atau untuk melakukan review konten secara massal di Microsoft Excel maupun Google Sheets.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(16,185,129,.1);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></div><button style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">Export CSV</button></div><div style=\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#15803d;font-weight:600;\">Downloaded: message-templates.csv</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
